  (text "USB-C power in, 5 V only (5.1 k on each CC), fed to the Pi through its header: a Power HAT+."
    (at 30.48 40.64 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "6ab9ebe2-0c24-41d7-a682-0d0e0dd3a3bd")
  )
  (text "U6 lets current flow one way only, is off below 4.4 V and above 6.1 V, limits at 4 A, rises in 5 ms."
